<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings--AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings--AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---12/07/96  11/30/96     Week</p>
<p> Grain		    22.1	25,788    21,129    25,932</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products  14.9	10,256     8,927     9,550</p>
<p> Other Farm Products  43.3	 2,444     1,706     1,897</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	  -2.7	17,143    17,611    19,909</p>
